:: Act3_School_MEP {"position":"900,1700","size":"100,100"}
<<nobr>>
<<set $currentLocation to "mep_space">>
<<set $activeMap to "Highschool Ground">>
<<set _arrivedLate to (visited("Act2_5_MarcusCabin"))>>
<</nobr>>

<div class="vn-container">
    <div class="vn-dialogue-box" style="justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; max-height: 100vh !important; padding: 20px; overflow-y: auto;">
        <div style="text-align:center; color:#888; font-size:0.8em; margin-bottom:15px; letter-spacing:3px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;">
            GROUND FLOOR — MEP MECHANICAL SPACE
        </div>

        <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 20px auto; border: 2px solid #333; overflow: hidden; position: relative; box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);">
            <img src="image/Act3_Timberline/mep.gif" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; opacity: 0.9; filter: contrast(1.1) brightness(0.9);">
        </div>

        <div style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); padding: 20px; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue); font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; color: #ccc; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 auto 25px auto; max-width: 700px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left;">
            <span id="vn-mep-main">
                The mechanical and electrical maintenance bay hums with tension. Overhead water pipes rattle and groan as the school's emergency backup generator throbs continuously, vibrating through the solid concrete floor.
                <br><br>
                The air is thick with heat, battery acid, and the bitter smell of burning diesel fuel. Breaker panels, shutoff valves, and wiring schematics cover the reinforced walls.
                <br><br>
                <<if not $looted_mep>>
                    A heavy steel maintenance workbench sits beneath a flickering bulb, cluttered with spare electrical hardware, wire spools, and toolboxes.
                    <br><br>
                    <div class="choice-menu">
                        <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-gold) !important;">
                            <<link "Search the generator workbench ▼">>
                                <<run $(".vn-dialogue-box").scrollTop(0)>>
                                <<addTime 5>>
                                <<set $looted_mep to true>>
                                <<run setup.addItem("Fuse", 1)>>
                                <<run setup.addItem("Multi-Tool", 1)>>
                                <<goto "Act3_School_MEP">>
                            <</link>>
                            <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-gold);">[LOOT]</b> Scavenge electrical components (1x Fuse, 1x Multi-Tool).</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                <<else>>
                    The electrical workbench has been cleared of useful maintenance supplies.
                <</if>>
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="choice-menu">
            <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-blue) !important;">
                <<link "🚪 Exit MEP Space to Locker Room [SOUTH]">>
                    <<goto "Act3_School_LockerRoom">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub">Step back into the athletic locker room.</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
